  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Accelerating Green Women&apos;s Entrepreneurship for More Sustainable Agriculture in Vietnam (WE4Ag)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;SO1: women entrepreneurs in the agriculture sector having increased capacity to apply sustainable/low emission/organic/green practices; &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;SO2: leveraging digital technology to reduce waste in production, harvesting, and add value to their&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;agricultural products; and by &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;SO3: facilitating access to (1) market for their green agricultural products for&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;and (2) financing resources for their business transition&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
